      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S TYRION (8) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (30.54) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Should be very hard to beat this time. WHITE MACK (1) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 6th at this track in a Grade 5. Goes very well from this draw with seven wins and five minor placings from 17 starts. Should be about the money. COOL HAND DON (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 520m behind Bionic Bill (30.52) in a Grade 4/5. In the mix. RITZA RINGER (6) form at this distance reads well.",
